{"tab":"new","page":13,"pages":471,"count":28232,"pageSize":60,"items":[{"id":"680493","ru":"Возвращение в Сайлент Хилл","en":"Return to Silent Hill","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":5.3,"votes":589,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/A9ZDsbc3NXc1u2wKs2RmF8YduNj.jpg","genres":["детектив","драма","ужасы"],"overview":"После исчезновения возлюбленной художник Джеймс Сандерленд пребывает в депрессии и топит печаль в алкоголе. Внезапно получив от неё письмо, он отправляется в место, где они когда-то были счастливы, — в курортный городок Сайлент Хилл в штате Мэн. Но Сайлент Хилл уже не тот.","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"mal_63709","ru":"こめかみっ！ Girls","en":"Komekami! Girls","year":"2026","type":"Аниме","rating":5.3,"votes":115,"poster":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1392/156024l.webp","genres":["Аниме"],"overview":"This is the story of the seven-sister unit \"Komekami! Girls,\" children of the rice deity, born from the tradition: \"In a single grain of rice, seven gods reside.\" When their mother (the deity of rice, or the rice-god queen) was called back in haste to the celestial realm and no longer able to return to the earthly realm they search for her traces using Usa City (Oita Prefecture) as their base, and teleport to Hachiman shrines throughout Kyushu island. As they solve local problems, they learn about food, take part in cooking battles, and grow.","source":"Jikan / MyAnimeList","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1107166","ru":"Убийца-психопат","en":"Psycho Killer","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":5.3,"votes":60,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/5xgxxmLivJXL8aF0HdZfpx8aAIo.jpg","genres":["криминал","ужасы","детектив"],"overview":"Неизвестный в маске едет по дорогам США, оставляя за собой кровавый след и множество трупов. В районе Небраски с психопатом случайно сталкивается полицейский, чья жена становится свидетелем жестокой расправы убийцей над ее любимым. Теперь, она и другой полицейский должны выследить преступника и остановить его прежде, чем он осуществит свой план массового убийства, который, по его задумке, откроет для него врата в ад.","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1323625","ru":"Ночной патруль","en":"Night Patrol","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":5.3,"votes":59,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/t93LPAZnurAd3Rcfdh7WzvsUKyz.jpg","genres":["ужасы","детектив","боевик"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"mal_62983","ru":"Marika's Love Meter Malfunction","en":"Marika-chan no Koukando wa Bukkowareteiru","year":"2026","type":"Аниме","rating":5.2,"votes":2323,"poster":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1818/155506l.webp","genres":["Аниме","Комедия","Comedy","Романтика","Romance","Этти","Ecchi"],"overview":"Confessing to my childhood friend Marika was impossible for someone as unpopular as me. So, I did what any desperate boy would do—I wished upon a shooting star! When I woke up, that dream had come true?! I could see a love meter for people, just like in a love simulation game. Once I realized this was real and not a dream I went straight to see Marika. Her love meter was so low it had broken and practically fallen all the way to hell! If she hated me so much why was she so nice?! Is this how she really felt or...?! (Source: Coolmic)","source":"Jikan / MyAnimeList","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"mal_63469","ru":"Beyond Twilight","en":"Hyakki Yakoushou","year":"2026","type":"Аниме","rating":5.2,"votes":319,"poster":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1589/156720l.webp","genres":["Аниме","Ужасы","Horror","Детектив","Mystery","Романтика","Romance","Сверхъестественное","Supernatural","Историческое"],"overview":"Ritsu inherited his sixth sense from his grandfather, along with a demon guardian named Blue Storm. Strange things just seem to happen around these two, and it's left to them to get to the bottom of all these mysterious events. Each story is independent but features recurring characters you'll come to know and appreciate as they, each in their own way, try to deal with things 'not of this world'. (Source: MU)","source":"Jikan / MyAnimeList","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1022453","ru":"Раджа","en":"ది రాజాసాబ్","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":5.2,"votes":30,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nvK6gYa4diCnQkDVN42uoYXPrdT.jpg","genres":["комедия","ужасы","фэнтези","боевик"],"overview":"За Гангаммой, страдающей болезнью Альцгеймера, ухаживает ее внук РаджаСааб. Она почти все забывает, но цепляется за воспоминания о своем муже Канакараджу, экзорцисте, который, как считается, живет в изгнании. Поиски деда приводят РаджаСааба в Хайдарабад, где он влюбляется в набожную монахиню Бесси, а другая женщина, внучка вора, по имени Бхайрави, предлагает помощь в поисках Канакараджу. В конце концов поиски приводят группу в печально известный особняк с привидениями. Они обнаруживают, что Канакараджу - не жертва, а виновник всех их бед...","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1449709","ru":"Agata Christian - Delitto sulle nevi","en":"Agata Christian - Delitto sulle nevi","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":4.8,"votes":56,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nLOF571J6YOTAmryyO5qOwSyURm.jpg","genres":["комедия","детектив"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1180417","ru":"Голландец","en":"The Dutchman","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":4.7,"votes":43,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/bmmt7ydPfSSSbuEvvnZRbyiLe7A.jpg","genres":["драма","триллер"],"overview":"Успешный чернокожий бизнесмен, терзаемый кризисом самоопределения и крахом своего брака, оказывается втянут в полную сексуального напряжения игру в «кошки-мышки» с таинственной белой женщиной в вагоне метро. Это противостояние неизбежно ведет к жестокой развязке.","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"mal_63304","ru":"Monster Eater","en":"Mamonogurai no Boukensha: Ore dake Mamono wo Kuratte Tsuyoku Naru","year":"2026","type":"Аниме","rating":4.1,"votes":2040,"poster":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1056/154990l.webp","genres":["Аниме","Экшен","Action","Фэнтези","Fantasy"],"overview":"Nobody wants \"Grubby Forager\" Rudd on their adventuring team. His nickname—and his stench—come from his constant treks into the Noxious Labyrinth to gather medicinal herbs, a job he survives only thanks to his status immunity skill. When he's finally recruited as a party porter, things seem to be looking up... Until a deadly dungeon monster appears and his fake allies use him as bait before abandoning him! Wounded, destitute, and barely surviving the attack, Rudd breaks a forbidden taboo to stay alive: eating monsters. But the more he devours, the more power he gains, kicking off a thrilling, adventurous gourmet fantasy! (Source: Square Enix)","source":"Jikan / MyAnimeList","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"mal_63433","ru":"The Regression of Great Sage Riddle","en":"Daikenja Riddle no Jikan Gyakkou","year":"2026","type":"Аниме","rating":4.1,"votes":889,"poster":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1764/155312l.webp","genres":["Аниме","Экшен","Action","Фэнтези","Fantasy","Путешествия во времени","Time Travel"],"overview":"A young man named Riddle had lost all of his friends—and the entire world—at the hands of a mysterious organization known as the \"Box of Malice.\" Having lost all hope to live, he dwelled in a pit of despair until he has one final revelation. What if... he could return to a time before everything ended? And so, after a thousand years, a deformed Riddle finally manages to reverse time. \"I'm going to stop them this time...!\" Equipped with a thousand years of knowledge and experience in his young body, the Great Sage Riddle's journey to the past now unfolds! (Source: Shogakukan, translated)","source":"Jikan / MyAnimeList","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1413097","ru":"Мелания","en":"Melania","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":3.6,"votes":154,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ba6Silct0Y4pyvrSv0Tj0Urmx9f.jpg","genres":["документальный"],"overview":"Документальный фильм о первой леди США Мелании Трамп. Точнее, о 20 днях ее жизни в январе 2025 года, посвященных подготовке к инаугурации ее мужа и возвращению в Белый дом после четырехлетнего перерыва.","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"309129","ru":"Убийца змей","en":"Slangedræber","year":"2026","type":"Сериал","rating":10.0,"votes":4,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/8TryQg47eUIR94pdwAEQtmWuvrB.jpg","genres":["криминал"],"overview":"Когда убивают осведомительницу, коп-одиночка Брайан вместе с такими же строптивыми офицерами из подразделения Uropatruljen ведет борьбу с преступным синдикатом, прибегая к жестким методам и нередко переступая границы закона.","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1648813","ru":"Bandage Poetry","en":"Bandage Poetry","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":10.0,"votes":4,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/xUVl9Y4ZkOxpGMSYcJRAwcvMM51.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1695248","ru":"2004","en":"2004","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":10.0,"votes":4,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/99xfWvF2T8RIPNV3nN8pKMU7vBJ.jpg","genres":["драма","комедия"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"313503","ru":"Skibet - Fem måneder for evigt","en":"Skibet - Fem måneder for evigt","year":"2026","type":"Сериал","rating":10.0,"votes":4,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/e462PnqT2zs0wivrKDGFakKQQbR.jpg","genres":["документальный"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"317430","ru":"We Were There","en":"We Were There","year":"2026","type":"Аниме","rating":10.0,"votes":3,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/lyYdWlBC2ECsIp83o6jf0rwvTMP.jpg","genres":["документальный","Аниме"],"overview":"Going into her first year of high school, Nanami Takahashi is filled with the hope of making many new friends. After meeting the shy Yuri Yamamoto, she hears about a popular boy in their class: Yano Motoharu. Yuri cares little for Yano because of his past relationship with her older sister Nana, and at first, Nanami doesn't like his attitude either. However, Nanami soon begins to warm up to Yano and takes a liking to him. The two spend more of their time together and eventually decide to start dating. But their love is not without challenges; Yano has trouble opening up to Nanami, since his first girlfriend, Nana, died in a car accident the year before, and she had been with one of her ex-boyfriends at the time. Finding themselves living in the shadow of Yano's relationship with Nana, Nanami and Yano struggle to keep their relationship afloat amid misunderstandings and heartache with the certainty of their love for each other. [Written by MAL Rewrite]","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"323411","ru":"Вампир Лестат","en":"The Vampire Lestat","year":"2026","type":"Сериал","rating":10.0,"votes":3,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ljVJisH9eGGomAA6pu62PPtHANq.jpg","genres":["драма","НФ и Фэнтези"],"overview":